response:
The report details a malicious phishing campaign attributed to the threat group UAC-0056. Malicious emails were distributed impersonating the National Police of Ukraine, carrying password-protected DOCX documents with embedded JavaScript files. When opened, the JavaScript executes PowerShell commands to download executable payloads hosted on Discord, resulting in the deployment of OutSteel document-stealing malware and SaintBot.

